---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../consts';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Lullaby"
  description="Lullaby is a private, local-first baby care tracker for Android."
>
  <article class="reading">
    <header class="post-header">
      <h1>Lullaby</h1>
      <p class="post-desc">A calm, private baby care tracker.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p>
        Lullaby helps parents record feeds, sleep, diapers, growth measurements,
        and gentle reminders without turning a tired day into data entry.
      </p>

      <h2>Free and local-only</h2>
      <p>
        The first Android release has no account, ads, analytics, cloud backend,
        partner sync, or in-app purchases. Baby profiles and care information stay
        inside Lullaby on the device where they were entered.
      </p>
      <p>
        Because there is no cloud copy, uninstalling Lullaby, clearing its app
        storage, or losing the device can permanently remove the information.
        The app includes Export All Data and Delete All Local Data controls.
      </p>

      <h2>Support</h2>
      <p>
        Questions or problems? Email
        {' '}<a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=Lullaby support`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
        Please do not include a child's health or identifying information in a
        support email.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="/lullaby/privacy/">Privacy policy</a>
        {' · '}
        <a href="/lullaby/data-deletion/">Data deletion instructions</a>
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        Lullaby does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any medical condition.
        Consult a qualified healthcare professional for medical advice.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
